PASS R1 Deadline reached before the create is sent is not recorded as uncertain; the visit syncs
PASS R1b Every pre-send rejection (gate closed, authority changed, deadline) is tagged as not sent; S1 window
PASS R2 One network error on create no longer blocks the visit for good; retry is the same ID and creates one event
